    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-7f11181d13eb131a6077f573",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "讨论了将参考信号引入状态变量反馈校正装置的两种常用方法：（1）选取M和N使估计误差独立于参考输入；（2）选取M和N使跟踪误差作为校正装置的输入。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Two common methods for introducing a reference signal into the state variable feedback compensator are discussed: (1) selecting M and N so that the estimation error is independent of the reference input, and (2) selecting M and N so that the tracking error is used as an input to the compensator.",
